></li><li><span class="rf-year">1134</span><span class="rf-text">Dashi conquers the Karakhanid city of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/balasagun">Balasaghun</a>; the Kankalis, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/karluks">Karluks</a>, Kyrgyz and the Kingdom of Qocho become <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/vassal">vassals</a>, while a Khitan attack on the Jin ends in disaster.</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1141</span><span class="rf-text">On 9 September the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/khitans">Khitans</a> destroy <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ahmad-sanjar">Ahmad Sanjar</a>'s Seljuk army at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-qatwan">Battle of Qatwan</a> north of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/samarkand">Samarkand</a>; <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/transoxiana">Transoxiana</a> is lost to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/seljuk-empire">Seljuks</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/khwarazm">Khwarazm</a> becomes a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/vassal">vassal</a>.</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1143</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yelu-dashi">Yelü Dashi</a> dies; his wife Xiao Tabuyan rules as regent with the titles of empress Gantian, Gurkhan and Dashi.</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1172</span><span class="rf-text">The Qara Khitai cross the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/oxus">Amu Darya</a> to defeat <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/khwarazm">Khwarazm</a> for unpaid tribute and install Tekish as Khwarazm Shah on 11 December.</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1198</span><span class="rf-text">A Qara Khitai army invading Ghurid lands near Kurzuban is routed in a night attack with 12,000 losses; <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/balkh">Balkh</a> passes to the Ghurids.</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1211</span><span class="rf-text">The Naiman refugee <a class="enc-link" href="/encycl